 "titulo": "v441 Update Details (9/27)",
 "fecha": 1538031272104,
 "modificada": 1729136984385,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1273283",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: black;\">Greetings, Agents.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: black;\">This is CM_Friday of MARVEL Future Fight. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: black;\">Our team would like to apologize for the issues that came with the latest update.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: black;\">In order to address the issues, we released Update v4.4.1 on 9/27.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #ff0000;\"> * You can download this update via Apple&rsquo;s App Store or the Google Play Store.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><u><span style=\"color: #1f3ed5;\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.netmarble.mherosgb&amp;hl=en\" target=\"_blank\">▶ [Google Play Store] Marvel Future Fight &#76;ink<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\" /> <!--[endif]--></a></span></u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><u><span style=\"color: #1f3ed5;\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/marvel-future-fight/id955705796?mt=8\" target=\"_blank\">▶ [Apple App Store] Marvel Future Fight &#76;ink</a></span></u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">This&nbsp;Update&nbsp;fixed the following:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1. Fixed an issue in the Limited Energy Event where the \"GO TO\" shortcut &#98;utton did not lead you to the intended content.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2. Fixed an issue where the Special Mission guide tutorial did not work.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">3. Fixed a visual glitch where: if you complete more than two Daily Challenges, the accumulated Shield EXP now appears on the Challenge you completed.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">4. Fixed an issue where the Hidden Route reward did not appear after using &ldquo;Auto-Repeat&rdquo;.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">5. Fixed an issue where the results screen of Timeline Battle appeared while playing the mode in &ldquo;Auto-Repeat&rdquo;.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">6. Fixed a visual glitch on the Epic Quest Guide UI where the Guide UI appeared in a position different than was intended.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">7. Fixed an issue where the Auto-Repeat completion and Boost Point additional reward notifications sometimes displayed differently.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">8. Fixed an issue where the camera in World Boss took on an abnormal viewing angle when Thanos entered and used his Ultimate Skill simultaneously.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">9. Fixed an issue in Legendary Battle where passive skills, stage buffs, Custom Gear, ISO-8, etc. did not work.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: black;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
}